  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS - BNCRCA CONTRACT # 2024-11 V053 CANBERRA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This market garden project aims to provide support to local farmers in Biche village, who are mostly women and girls to plant market gardens through provision of relevant tools and planting materials. Secondly, the project will support them to access market. This includes providing logistics and transportation system to bring the produce to market outlets. Market outlets will be inside the Marovo Lagoon, these sites are local sea ports where inter-island shipping comes every week. In these ports are open market houses. One that is nearest to the village is Bunikalo port and the first areas produce from this project will be sold</narrative>
  </description>
